      "content": "That's a good start with the GI stuff, but doctors are going to be sharper than that. They're going to specifically ask about the neurological/dizziness side effects. Most of the feedback I'm seeing suggests CardioZen has a slightly higher incidence of mild dizziness compared to the competitor. How should the reps handle that? We can't let that one data point kill our momentum.",
